1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,700
ONLY ONE GOALKEEPER

2
00:00:01,700 --> 00:00:03,780
HAS EVER WON THE BALLON D'OR.

3
00:00:03,910 --> 00:00:04,710
NOT BUFFON.

4
00:00:05,220 --> 00:00:05,950
NOT NEUER.

5
00:00:06,500 --> 00:00:07,470
NOT CASILLAS.

6
00:00:07,940 --> 00:00:10,170
HIS NAME WAS LEV YASHIN.

7
00:00:10,690 --> 00:00:12,300
IN 1963, HE ACHIEVED

8
00:00:12,300 --> 00:00:15,540
SOMETHING NO OTHER GOALKEEPER
HAS EVER MATCHED.

9
00:00:16,040 --> 00:00:18,180
THEY CALLED HIM THE BLACK SPIDER.

10
00:00:18,580 --> 00:00:21,600
WITH LIGHTNING-FAST REFLEXES
AND FEARLESS CONTROL

11
00:00:21,600 --> 00:00:22,700
OF HIS PENALTY AREA,

12
00:00:22,700 --> 00:00:24,970
YASHIN CHANGED THE WAY
GOALKEEPERS PLAYED.

13
00:00:25,430 --> 00:00:28,820
MORE THAN SIXTY YEARS LATER,
HIS RECORD STILL STANDS.

14
00:00:29,320 --> 00:00:30,270
WHO'S NEXT?
